# Where booking enquiries go.
#
# Option A — endpoint (recommended): any service that accepts a JSON POST with
# { name, email, phone, venue, occasion, date, message, submittedAt }, e.g. a
# Formspree form URL, your own serverless function, or an API route.
# When set, the form posts in place and shows inline success/error states.
VITE_BOOKING_ENDPOINT=

# Option B — fallback: a prefilled mailto: link opens the visitor's mail app.
# Used when no endpoint is configured, and as the failure advice for the user.
VITE_BOOKING_EMAIL=
